WEBVTT

01:42.685 --> 01:46.940
My father, Yuichiro,
and I are totally different people.

01:47.023 --> 01:48.775
We're polar opposites.

01:49.526 --> 01:53.947
Our outlooks on life, the way we live,
and even the techniques we use.

01:54.572 --> 01:59.452
Even so, there is
one single technique of his

02:00.203 --> 02:02.455
I am reluctantly proud of.

02:02.539 --> 02:04.707
It's that! It's that one, isn't--

02:04.791 --> 02:05.708
Shut up!

02:12.549 --> 02:15.969
This is what the Marines
called this technique.

02:17.762 --> 02:18.721
"Dress."

02:30.567 --> 02:32.235
<i>Nunchucks?</i>

02:34.445 --> 02:36.990
Translated directly, if you will,

02:37.073 --> 02:40.243
we'll call it "attire."

02:44.080 --> 02:48.001
<i>Everyone, do you think
my way of educating goes too far?</i>

02:52.463 --> 02:54.007
<i>Human nunchucks.</i>

02:54.924 --> 02:58.261
<i>Just what is the person
it's being done to seeing?</i>

02:58.344 --> 03:01.264
<i>Not "seeing," but "saw."</i>

03:02.265 --> 03:06.394
<i>Their view switches at ultra-high speed,
and so it changes in an instant</i>

03:06.477 --> 03:08.771
<i>to "the past" and then to "a memory."</i>

03:09.981 --> 03:12.150
<i>The never-before-experienced
centrifugal force</i>

03:12.233 --> 03:14.527
<i>causes blood to collect in the head.</i>

03:15.111 --> 03:18.531
<i>The nose, mouth, ears, and eyes.</i>

03:19.657 --> 03:23.536
<i>These orifices function
as an exit for the blood to escape.</i>

03:24.204 --> 03:31.044
<i>The ground, the sky,
the people, the scenery... are red.</i>

03:32.587 --> 03:35.048
<i>Dad is... red.</i>

03:36.257 --> 03:40.053
<i>In addition, the massive amount
of blood that flows into the eyes</i>

03:40.720 --> 03:43.640
<i>causes what's known
in the aviation industry as "red-out",</i>

03:44.265 --> 03:46.184
<i>making even the night sky appear red.</i>

03:48.186 --> 03:51.064
<i>The massive energy
suddenly produced before their eyes...</i>

03:51.731 --> 03:54.567
<i>It was obvious at a glance
that this was beyond their control.</i>

03:55.485 --> 03:57.070
<i>The level of danger was like</i>

03:58.279 --> 04:00.073
<i>a hammer throw in a locked room.</i>

04:01.574 --> 04:06.079
<i>The area within a 100-meter radius
became nearly void of people.</i>

04:10.208 --> 04:13.836
I get it now. Front and back,
left and right, above and below.

04:14.629 --> 04:21.344
Baki is now a semi-transparent "dress"
that veils Yujiro.

04:24.639 --> 04:27.350
I would never be able
to copy what he's doing.

04:27.433 --> 04:30.895
Even if I could lightly throw a person
around as if they were a towel,

04:30.979 --> 04:34.482
I could never use them skillfully
as if they were a tool.

04:34.565 --> 04:36.859
Not like a weapon I'm long familiar with.

04:37.443 --> 04:39.904
A weapon? That's it!

04:41.155 --> 04:43.866
<i>Nunchucks aren't simply tools.</i>

04:44.951 --> 04:46.119
<i>They're a weapon!</i>

04:46.202 --> 04:49.622
If that's the case,
then what comes next is...

04:53.209 --> 04:55.003
Baki, can you hear me?

04:57.213 --> 05:00.216
<i>Whether you can hear me or not,</i>

05:01.843 --> 05:02.927
<i>protect yourself!</i>

05:03.011 --> 05:04.804
<i>Protect your body!</i>

05:05.513 --> 05:07.307
<i>If you call yourself a Hanma,</i>

05:08.016 --> 05:09.559
<i>then fully protect yourself!</i>

05:10.643 --> 05:11.561
<i>Don't you die!</i>

05:15.481 --> 05:18.318
<i>The car his father struck
flipped halfway over.</i>

05:19.569 --> 05:22.905
<i>The weapon he used was his own son.</i>

05:27.160 --> 05:30.330
<i>Everyone, don't underestimate</i>

05:31.205 --> 05:32.248
<i>my son.</i>

05:34.208 --> 05:35.418
<i>This boy,</i>

05:36.419 --> 05:38.588
<i>Baki Hanma... don't underestimate him.</i>

05:39.672 --> 05:42.592
<i>Don't underestimate the power
that is Baki Hanma.</i>

05:43.217 --> 05:44.594
Beautiful.

05:45.303 --> 05:46.596
I'm envious.

05:49.307 --> 05:51.684
<i>What an incredibly trusting relationship.</i>

05:53.644 --> 05:54.896
<i>I knew it.</i>

05:54.979 --> 05:57.106
<i>No doubt about it. I've got it.</i>

05:58.107 --> 05:59.859
<i>I've been gifted with the ability.</i>

06:00.693 --> 06:02.111
<i>Faced with these attacks,</i>

06:02.945 --> 06:04.447
<i>I am handling them.</i>

06:06.074 --> 06:07.617
<i>I'm fully protecting myself.</i>

06:08.201 --> 06:10.119
<i>This corner I'm about to ram into...</i>

06:10.828 --> 06:13.873
<i>The glass, the tire, the equipment...</i>

06:14.582 --> 06:17.126
<i>I am handling all of it.</i>

06:18.127 --> 06:19.379
<i>I've already repelled them.</i>

06:20.171 --> 06:24.634
<i>Already dodged, avoided,
and sometimes destroyed them.</i>

06:25.593 --> 06:29.138
<i>Even with what I'm facing...</i>

06:31.516 --> 06:33.643
<i>I am constantly recovering.</i>

06:38.481 --> 06:42.235
Hey now, how long you gonna hold hands
with me like we're buddies?

06:43.236 --> 06:45.405
You planning on taking a walk with me?

06:46.322 --> 06:47.156
No.

06:48.074 --> 06:51.661
I've got a present for you,
sort of as a "thank you."

06:54.247 --> 06:55.540
Please, accept it.

06:59.502 --> 07:02.422
I feel bad about doing all the receiving.

07:05.758 --> 07:07.927
This is one shitty doll.

07:08.594 --> 07:11.431
It's not really a doll,
but more like a samurai.

07:12.682 --> 07:14.434
When did you make this?

07:15.184 --> 07:17.562
<i>While I was being slammed against stuff.</i>

07:19.105 --> 07:21.566
<i>One by one, and one by one.</i>

07:22.400 --> 07:24.694
<i>I connected and inserted them.</i>

07:25.778 --> 07:28.781
I meant for it to look
a lot cooler than that though.

07:29.282 --> 07:30.867
Its arms and legs are a bit--

07:30.950 --> 07:31.951
That's not right.

07:32.535 --> 07:34.454
I noticed when I was slamming you.

07:35.371 --> 07:38.958
<i>The impact that I should have felt,
that should have run through my hand,</i>

07:39.041 --> 07:40.751
<i>wasn't quite completely there.</i>

07:42.795 --> 07:44.714
I thought you were pulling a trick.

07:45.715 --> 07:48.259
Against hard, sharp points of impact,

07:48.342 --> 07:51.220
you repelled, dodged, and destroyed...

07:51.804 --> 07:54.223
You fully protected yourself.

07:55.308 --> 07:58.728
You were not "slammed" by me.

07:59.312 --> 08:01.981
Its arms and legs are a bit rough.

08:04.609 --> 08:06.736
What did you say earlier?

08:07.320 --> 08:10.239
You mean "doing all the receiving"?

08:14.702 --> 08:16.996
That's what I mean, Father.

08:18.998 --> 08:20.583
I've already received

08:22.126 --> 08:23.669
the victory from you!

08:40.269 --> 08:43.523
<i>I really was bored through and through.</i>

08:45.650 --> 08:49.529
<i>I was getting fed up
with this thing called life.</i>

08:52.615 --> 08:54.033
<i>I forget when,</i>

08:54.992 --> 08:59.747
<i>but five condemned criminals
from all over, assembled together.</i>

09:01.958 --> 09:04.293
<i>The five all had a good look to them.</i>

09:05.628 --> 09:06.837
<i>Their motto was,</i>

09:08.464 --> 09:10.174
<i>"We want to know defeat."</i>

09:12.718 --> 09:14.679
<i>I understand that.</i>

09:15.263 --> 09:16.847
<i>I understand it painfully well.</i>

09:17.890 --> 09:21.561
<i>Before I knew it,
I realized I was standing there,</i>

09:22.687 --> 09:24.188
<i>at the pinnacle.</i>

09:25.648 --> 09:28.943
<i>Where there was nothing else to aim for.</i>

09:29.902 --> 09:31.529
<i>There was no path to take.</i>

09:32.863 --> 09:36.284
<i>But even so, I couldn't just stop walking.</i>

09:37.535 --> 09:40.705
<i>So I went walking, in search of a path.</i>

09:41.706 --> 09:43.791
<i>None of you would understand.</i>

09:45.042 --> 09:47.920
<i>Having nothing to be challenged by
is a tragedy.</i>

09:49.213 --> 09:51.132
<i>None of you would understand.</i>

09:51.924 --> 09:55.970
<i>When strength is taken to extremes,
it takes all your dreams away.</i>

09:56.053 --> 10:01.475
<i>When strength is taken to extremes,
all the light is stolen from life.</i>

10:02.059 --> 10:04.478
<i>Wealth. Fame. Status.</i>

10:05.438 --> 10:09.358
<i>With this much physical power,
all of it is within easy reach</i>.

10:10.735 --> 10:12.862
<i>None of you would understand.</i>

10:13.821 --> 10:17.366
<i>I'm so goddamn strong,
nothing is a challenge!</i>

11:10.002 --> 11:11.921
<i>Say, Baki...</i>

11:18.302 --> 11:20.930
<i>Being a parent is a great thing.</i>

11:29.438 --> 11:32.441
<i>Just father and son,
with no one to disturb us.</i>

11:34.026 --> 11:35.111
Didn't he suffer...

11:35.194 --> 11:36.445
Any damage?

11:37.029 --> 11:42.201
<i>Take pleasure in being
a father and being a son.</i>

11:42.910 --> 11:45.705
<i>It sure is a nice, being a parent.</i>

11:46.872 --> 11:47.707
Right?

11:50.710 --> 11:52.712
I don't know why you're saying "Right?"

11:53.295 --> 11:55.464
But just as I expected. No,

11:56.590 --> 11:59.051
even more than I expected,
we are connected.

11:59.552 --> 12:02.471
You're a bona fide Hanma.

12:04.557 --> 12:07.810
I'm not against living as a Hanma.

12:13.524 --> 12:14.859
<i>What is it to be a Hanma?</i>

12:15.651 --> 12:18.988
<i>There's no need to ask. It feels like...</i>

12:20.364 --> 12:24.744
<i>That's right, I am,
without a doubt, a genuine Hanma child.</i>

12:26.829 --> 12:31.500
<i>No matter how much you try and try,
you obtain more than what you try for.</i>

12:33.586 --> 12:34.879
<i>So that's why</i>

12:35.838 --> 12:37.423
<i>I gave up.</i>

12:39.383 --> 12:41.510
<i>I'll be the one to take care of you, Dad!</i>

12:42.511 --> 12:44.013
<i>We're father and son, after all.</i>

12:46.098 --> 12:49.518
<i>Nice... nice punch!</i>

12:50.811 --> 12:54.523
<i>I can't remember the last time I got
punched through the abdomen like that.</i>

12:57.276 --> 13:00.029
Dad, are you bored?

13:07.119 --> 13:09.038
Hating boredom,

13:09.872 --> 13:11.791
I traveled across Japan and abroad,

13:12.583 --> 13:15.836
on the far side of the Earth,
even to the North Pole.

13:17.505 --> 13:21.300
<i>I played with martial artists, athletes,</i>

13:22.051 --> 13:26.806
<i>savage beasts, giant animals, weapons,</i>

13:27.431 --> 13:32.186
<i>the underworld, state powers, and armies.</i>

13:33.270 --> 13:37.191
<i>But who'd have thought I'd find the toy
to satisfy me, like none of those could,</i>

13:37.274 --> 13:39.151
so close to me.

13:40.027 --> 13:41.779
Not just close.

13:42.279 --> 13:45.616
That's right. We're not just close.

13:46.116 --> 13:48.786
The elusive dream
I wandered all over seeking

13:49.662 --> 13:53.457
wasn't just in my own home,
it was a part of me!

13:59.797 --> 14:04.468
Dad, when a child gets a toy,
what do you think happens?

14:07.221 --> 14:10.850
<i>They'll play with it like crazy,
and play, and play</i>

14:12.142 --> 14:13.853
<i>until at last they destroy it.</i>

14:19.942 --> 14:20.943
<i>Death.</i>

14:21.944 --> 14:23.362
- That's right.
- Huh?

14:28.200 --> 14:29.201
Why are you here?

14:29.994 --> 14:31.120
"Why?"

14:31.954 --> 14:34.540
The world's strongest father-son fight.

14:35.165 --> 14:37.126
It's all over the TV and the Internet!

14:37.918 --> 14:39.712
But that's enough.

14:40.212 --> 14:43.382
If you're gonna fight, then fight.
If you're gonna stop, then stop.

14:43.966 --> 14:45.885
You throw a few punches, then yammer on.

14:45.968 --> 14:48.387
You throw a few kicks,
then get all sentimental.

14:48.470 --> 14:51.390
I can't stand to watch,
it's so darn tedious!

14:52.975 --> 14:54.184
Who's that?

14:54.268 --> 14:55.895
They'll kill her!

14:56.812 --> 14:58.480
This isn't a competition at all!

14:58.981 --> 15:00.482
This isn't a match.

15:01.066 --> 15:03.402
However, this is a competition.

15:06.405 --> 15:08.157
We're father and son, after all.

15:08.741 --> 15:11.660
Of course we talk and get sentimental.

15:12.369 --> 15:17.124
And gratefully, there are some "games"
that only a father and son can play.

15:18.125 --> 15:19.877
The techniques I used tonight,

15:20.628 --> 15:23.797
most of them I only used
because I was facing my dad.

15:24.465 --> 15:27.301
They're deadly techniques
that can't be used against people.

15:29.386 --> 15:31.055
My dad, too,

15:32.139 --> 15:35.559
all the techniques he let loose
were like military weapons.

15:36.268 --> 15:37.102
Kozue...

15:38.479 --> 15:40.814
That's exactly why you stopped us, right?

15:41.649 --> 15:43.692
"If you can afford to converse,

15:43.776 --> 15:46.070
if you love each other so much
you get sentimental,

15:46.654 --> 15:48.405
<i>then why don't you stop fighting?"</i>

15:49.657 --> 15:51.158
<i>"If you're going to die,</i>

15:52.159 --> 15:54.328
<i>if you're going to kill one another</i>,

15:55.245 --> 15:57.331
<i>then why don't you just accept losing?"</i>

15:58.707 --> 16:01.502
<i>Kozue, since you're a woman,</i>

16:01.585 --> 16:03.587
<i>it must be hard for you to understand.</i>

16:03.671 --> 16:05.339
Whoa! <i>Aiki!</i>

16:07.675 --> 16:09.927
<i>All the techniques
we've continued to master.</i>

16:10.719 --> 16:12.596
<i>All the pain we've accumulated.</i>

16:13.180 --> 16:16.100
<i>And the joy
that we can fully exhibit them.</i>

16:25.609 --> 16:28.112
<i>The happiness of being able
to freely let loose!</i>

16:29.071 --> 16:32.616
<i>What my dad means to me,
and what I mean to my dad...</i>

16:33.450 --> 16:37.121
<i>It's someone who can indulge those things.</i>

16:39.206 --> 16:41.375
<i>We're each other's one and only!</i>

16:43.711 --> 16:48.507
<i>The father and son engage
in a battle beyond human scale.</i>

16:51.593 --> 16:53.595
<i>Sublime superhuman techniques.</i>

16:56.056 --> 16:57.599
Awesome...

16:58.851 --> 17:00.853
<i>Now, those who were keeping order</i>

17:00.936 --> 17:04.023
<i>had turned to face
the same direction as the onlookers,</i>

17:04.815 --> 17:08.027
<i>and gripped their special batons
in sweaty palms.</i>

17:08.694 --> 17:11.989
<i>What they were witnessing now was</i>

17:13.407 --> 17:14.491
<i>the pinnacle.</i>

17:15.117 --> 17:17.077
<i>The embodiment of strength.</i>

17:17.161 --> 17:20.622
<i>High-grade, concentrated strength itself.</i>

17:21.165 --> 17:23.042
<i>It's only natural they took interest.</i>

17:41.518 --> 17:44.313
No matter how much
you're devoured, and devoured,

17:45.439 --> 17:47.066
and devoured,

17:48.025 --> 17:50.569
be a woman
who cannot be devoured completely.

17:51.445 --> 17:55.115
You're saying I failed to listen to you?

17:55.657 --> 18:01.038
It doesn't matter to me whether my son
devoured you completely or not.

18:02.414 --> 18:05.918
One thing that's certain is
that Baki has grown stronger.

18:08.796 --> 18:12.341
It can't be unrelated. Thank you.

18:12.925 --> 18:15.427
I don't think I need your thanks.

18:15.928 --> 18:18.388
I didn't do it to make Baki strong--

18:18.472 --> 18:19.348
Your time is up.

18:21.475 --> 18:23.894
This isn't a place
for a woman to stick around.

18:23.977 --> 18:29.108
Before you get knocked down,
you'd better hide, or you'll get hurt.

18:31.819 --> 18:34.113
I won't obey. You see...

18:37.825 --> 18:41.411
<i>The young man, the father,
and the girlfriend</i>

18:42.412 --> 18:43.914
<i>had begun to realize something.</i>

18:46.291 --> 18:47.167
<i>It was close.</i>

18:47.960 --> 18:50.170
<i>The end was close.</i>

18:51.213 --> 18:52.923
<i>Just how many people were there?</i>

18:53.423 --> 18:57.177
<i>The high-rise neighborhood was packed
with people, people, and more people.</i>

18:58.053 --> 19:01.181
<i>Even if just for one glance,
I want to see it with my own eyes.</i>

19:01.265 --> 19:06.186
<i>What disappeared from my body and life.</i>

19:07.187 --> 19:08.438
<i>The wildness,</i>

19:09.273 --> 19:10.691
<i>I want to see it!</i>

19:13.610 --> 19:15.487
<i>We've obtained academic merit,</i>

19:16.280 --> 19:19.449
<i>status, and even a decent income.</i>

19:20.367 --> 19:24.204
<i>But as a result, what was it we lost?</i>

19:32.254 --> 19:36.133
<i>This whittling down of muscle
had already been going on for a few hours.</i>

19:39.052 --> 19:41.346
<i>The strongest
father-son fight in the world...</i>

19:41.972 --> 19:43.223
<i>A family discord.</i>

19:44.057 --> 19:47.227
<i>Parents with children.
Children with parents.</i>

19:47.936 --> 19:50.564
<i>Many parents and children
began to realize something.</i>

19:52.566 --> 19:53.942
<i>"This father-son fight</i>

19:55.777 --> 19:56.737
<i>is not discord."</i>

19:59.281 --> 20:00.991
<i>"This is harmony!"</i>

20:07.956 --> 20:10.250
<i>"All the parents and children in the world</i>

20:11.126 --> 20:13.921
<i>ought to regard this relationship
as their role model!"</i>

20:17.549 --> 20:18.675
<i>Wow.</i>

20:20.010 --> 20:23.889
<i>My dad's head. The skull of Yujiro Hanma.</i>

20:24.514 --> 20:26.975
<i>I've never touched it before in this way.</i>

20:28.101 --> 20:29.311
<i>It's so warm.</i>

20:31.813 --> 20:33.273
<i>What a night.</i>

20:33.899 --> 20:36.652
<i>Everything I've cultivated,
I was able to use all of it.</i>

20:37.486 --> 20:40.781
<i>This man, he accepted all of it.</i>

20:42.366 --> 20:44.534
<i>And then there's even this surprise.</i>

20:46.536 --> 20:47.371
Baki.

20:48.372 --> 20:49.206
Yeah?

20:52.417 --> 20:53.543
Right?

20:56.004 --> 20:57.047
"Right" what?

20:58.131 --> 20:59.216
It's not easy to say.

21:03.428 --> 21:04.304
<i>Each of them...</i>

21:06.390 --> 21:07.307
<i>Each and all...</i>

21:10.394 --> 21:12.688
<i>They sensed the ending of the feast,</i>

21:13.605 --> 21:14.940
<i>and prepared themselves.</i>

21:18.443 --> 21:19.611
Baki.

21:19.695 --> 21:20.696
Yeah?

21:20.779 --> 21:21.697
It's about time.

21:22.281 --> 21:23.282
Yeah.

21:23.365 --> 21:25.325
Have you done everything you wanted to?

21:27.202 --> 21:28.036
Yes.

21:40.173 --> 21:41.466
Now, now.

21:43.343 --> 21:44.428
<i>This is no good.</i>

21:51.101 --> 21:52.436
<i>This isn't easy for me.</i>

21:55.022 --> 21:56.732
<i>I want to continue.</i>

21:56.815 --> 21:59.234
<i>In the cosmos...</i>

22:01.695 --> 22:02.988
<i>all things must pass.</i>

22:04.156 --> 22:06.241
<i>There is an end to everything.</i>
